@startuml
' Source Use Case: UC-021 — View Shopping Recommendations
' Primary Specification: ../use-cases/UC-021-view-shopping-recommendations.md
' Supporting Authorities: ../SRS.md (v0.3); ../business-rules.md (v0.1.2)
' Business/Product: ../../01-business/BRD.md (v0.3); ../../02-product/PRD.md (v0.2)
' Master Actors/Scope: ../use-cases/use-case-diagram.puml
' Process Authority: ../../../Initial files/CapsuleAI_Scrum_Development_Workflow.md, Sections 11, 39–42, 46
' Version: 0.1; Status: Baseline Draft
' SRS trace: FR-SHOP-001, FR-SHOP-002, FR-SHOP-003, FR-SHOP-004, FR-SHOP-006, FR-SHOP-007, FR-SHOP-008, DATA-ANL-003, ERR-SHOP-001, ERR-SHOP-002, ERR-SHOP-003
' Rule trace: BRULE-AUTH-001, BRULE-SHOP-001, BRULE-SHOP-002, BRULE-SHOP-003, BRULE-MULT-004, BRULE-MULT-005, BRULE-MULT-006, BRULE-MULT-007, BRULE-MULT-008
' Flow coverage: UC Sections 6–10; alternatives and failures retain their textual meaning.
' The textual Use Case Specification remains the normative behavioral source.

title AD-021 - View Shopping Recommendations
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false

|User|
start
:Request candidates from supported gap/advice context;
|CapsuleAI|
if (Authorized advice access usable?) then (Yes)
    :Identify supported wardrobe gap/context;
else (No)
    :Pause protected use; require renewed access (UC-002);
    stop
endif
repeat
    :Retrieve available credible candidate advice;
    if (Advice retrieval available?) then (Yes)
        if (Useful candidate recommendation available?) then (Yes)
            :Present supported candidate identity/visual,
category/subtype, gap and attributes;
            note right
              Descriptors need explicit user evidence
              or an identifiable configured credible source.
              No capture/import goal is added.
            end note
            |User|
            :Select a hypothetical candidate to inspect;
            |CapsuleAI|
            :Identify evaluation basis and current utility status;
            if (Relevant prior basis changed?) then (Yes)
                :Refresh assessment or label prior result Outdated;
                :Do not make old result current after failed refresh;
            endif
            switch (Established utility outcome?)
                case (Exact)
                    :Show exact +N and same-basis hypothetical previews;
                case (Evaluated Zero)
                    :Show completed +0 with reasons;
                case (Incomplete)
                    :Explain missing/partial evidence; withhold exact count;
                case (Unavailable)
                    :Explain unavailable utility; retain useful gap context;
                case (Outdated)
                    :Label prior count/previews Outdated;
            endswitch
            :Explain supported utility reasons and limitations;
            if (Credible optional commercial information available?) then (Yes)
                :Retain identifiable source and retrieval/last-checked time;
                if (Price/availability older than 24 hours?) then (Yes)
                    :Refresh, explicitly qualify stale/last checked, or omit;
                else (No / not applicable)
                    :Show supported current informational guidance;
                endif
                :Qualify estimates; omit unsupported merchant claims;
            else (No)
                :Omit absent/unverified commercial fields;
            endif
            note right
              Commercial information is optional to utility.
              Missing price/link or destination failure does not
              imply +0, ownership or a transaction outcome.
            end note
            |User|
            :Evaluate advice and choose next action;
            if (Request candidate evaluation?) then (Yes)
                :Continue through UC-022 as a separate goal;
                stop
            endif
            if (Explicitly choose offered available external link?) then (Yes)
                :Continue through optional UC-023;
                stop
            endif
            :Dismiss or continue browsing without shopping;
        else (No useful candidate)
            |CapsuleAI|
            :Explain honest no-useful/evaluable-candidate result;
            |User|
            :Continue gap/wardrobe/context work;
            stop
        endif
    else (Unavailable)
        |CapsuleAI|
        :Explain unavailable advice; do not infer no candidate or no gap;
        |User|
        :Review available gap/wardrobe context;
    endif
    |User|
repeat while (Continue browsing or retry advice?) is (Yes) not (No)
|CapsuleAI|
:Finish without ownership, purchase or Wear changes;
stop

@enduml
